    {
      "code": "MEMBER",
      "cross_product": false,
      "description": "Everyone. Sees the organization chart and edits their own profile. Everyone raises requests, decides what the routing chain sends them, and may hand over while away. Holding decide:OWN is not authority by itself \u2014 ADR-0006 \u00a76's eligibility check is what actually decides who may answer.",
