    {
      "code": "APPROVAL_ADMIN",
      "cross_product": false,
      "description": "All four approval permissions at ORG, nothing else. HRMS's HR_ADMIN cannot be granted core.* directly (ADR-0000 \u00a75's corollary \u2014 a product's admin role is built from that product's own catalogue), so an HR administrator who needs the unassigned queue is given this role alongside HR_ADMIN. Deliberately not the product's admin-most template: `ORG_OWNER` already holds every `core` grant, so marking this one admin-most too would be redundant and it is not auto-granted on activation.",
